Which member price does the selected strategy print?

```java
interface Pricing { int total(int base); }
class RegularPricing implements Pricing {
  public int total(int base) { return base; }
}
class MemberPricing implements Pricing {
  public int total(int base) { return base * 9 / 10; }
}
Pricing policy = new MemberPricing();
System.out.println(policy.total(1000));
```
